# API Test Coverage

- Add automated tests for every API route and server mutation.
- Cover the successful path, input validation, missing resources, and domain conflicts where applicable.
- Verify response status and body as well as persisted database changes.
- Keep tests deterministic and isolate database state between cases.
- When fixing an API bug, add a regression test that fails without the fix.
- Prefer focused API integration tests over mocks that bypass route and persistence behavior.
